        "text": "Step 1: Since \\( p(x) \\) is a quadratic polynomial with integer coefficients and \\( 4 - \\sqrt{11} \\) is a root, its conjugate \\( 4 + \\sqrt{11} \\) must also be a root. Therefore, we can express \\( p(x) \\) as:\n\\[ p(x) = a(x - (4 - \\sqrt{11}))(x - (4 + \\sqrt{11})) \\]\nfor some integer \\( a \\)."
