        "text": "Step 2: Simplify the expression inside the parentheses:\n\\[ p(x) = a((x - 4) + \\sqrt{11})((x - 4) - \\sqrt{11}) = a((x - 4)^2 - (\\sqrt{11})^2) = a((x - 4)^2 - 11) = a(x^2 - 8x + 16 - 11) = a(x^2 - 8x + 5). \\]"
