        "text": "Step 3: To find \\( \\frac{p(3)}{p(4)} \\), substitute \\( x = 3 \\) and \\( x = 4 \\) into the polynomial:\n\\[ p(3) = a(3^2 - 8 \\cdot 3 + 5) = a(9 - 24 + 5) = a(-10), \\]\n\\[ p(4) = a(4^2 - 8 \\cdot 4 + 5) = a(16 - 32 + 5) = a(-11). \\]"
